        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2134, Square Passage Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Passage Square Tubular Pocket Door Set comes packaged as a complete set with 2 square flush pulls, an edge pull, and a passage strike. The Pop Out Edge Pull is spring loaded and can be ejected from the door's edge with the press of a finger. It is easy to grab in order to slide the door from the pocket. This Square Passage Pocket Door Hardware can be used on doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch backsets. Choose from a huge selection of finish color options. Emtek's 2134 Square Pocket Door Tubular Passage Set is a modern addition to pocket door hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features a pop out edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket as well as a strike with raised detail to auto-retract the edge pull when closing the door.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/dummy-square-pocket-door-set-emtek-2136\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/privacy-square-tubular-pocket-door-set-emtek-2135\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Passage Square Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Maximum Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2134-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262400\"><b>Emtek 2134 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a pop-out edge pull, a passage strike, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Passage Square Tubular Pocket Door Set",
                "description": "The Passage Square Tubular Pocket Door Set comes packaged as a complete set with 2 square flush pulls, an edge pull, and a passage strike. The Pop Out Edge Pull is spring loaded and can be ejected from the door's edge with the press of a finger. It is easy to grab in order to slide the door from the pocket. This Square Passage Pocket Door Hardware can be used on doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch backsets. Choose from a huge selection of finish color options. Emtek's 2134 Square Pocket Door Tubular Passage Set is a modern addition to pocket door hardware.",
